---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="CONTACT | Nago Youth Future Summit 2026">
	<main>
		<section class="page-header">
			<div class="container">
				<h1>CONTACT</h1>
				<p>お問い合わせ</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="section">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="card">
					<h2>主催・運営組織</h2>
					
					<dl class="info-list">
						<dt>主催</dt>
						<dd>Nago city Youth Creative（NYC）</dd>
						<dt>協力</dt>
						<dd>名護市内外の連携団体・企業（全10団体想定）</dd>
					</dl>

					<div class="contact-box">
						<h3>✉️ メールでのお問い合わせ</h3>
						<p>イベントに関するご質問、取材・協賛、うみポス企画等のお問い合わせは、以下のメールアドレスまでご連絡ください。</p>
						
						<a href="mailto:nyc.summit.umipos@outlook.jp" class="email-link">
							nyc.summit.umipos@outlook.jp
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #0284c7 0%, #0369a1 100%);
		color: white;
		padding: 4rem 0;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.page-header h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 800;
	}
	.page-header p {
		color: #93c5fd;
		font-size: 1rem;
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
	}
	.section {
		padding: 3rem 0;
	}
	.card {
		background: white;
		border-radius: 16px;
		padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
	}
	.card h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: #0f172a;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #bae6fd;
		padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.info-list {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr;
		row-gap: 1rem;
		column-gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	.info-list dt {
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #334155;
	}
	.info-list dd {
		color: #475569;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.contact-box {
		background: #f8fafc;
		border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.contact-box h3 {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: #0369a1;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}
	.contact-box p {
		color: #64748b;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	.email-link {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #0284c7;
		text-decoration: underline;
		padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
		background: #ffffff;
		border: 1px solid #bae6fd;
		border-radius: 8px;
		transition: all 0.2s;
		word-break: break-all;
	}
	.email-link:hover {
		color: #0369a1;
		background: #f0f9ff;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.info-list {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			row-gap: 0.2rem;
		}
		.info-list dt {
			margin-top: 0.6rem;
		}
	}
</style>
